     "w": 89,
     "h": 20
    },
    {
     "p": "Let $u =$ tan $\\theta$ . Then $du =$ sec$^{2} \\theta d\\theta$ . Recall that sec$^{2} \\theta =$ 1 + tan$^{2} \\theta$ ."
    },
    {
     "img": "g1/p2-11.png",
     "w": 227,
